@format 1
@id preview.close-media
@title Close media
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Hide the host, synchronously detach and dispose playback, clear preview state, and publish empty media; lifecycle callers also clear the tab flow directly.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge, Funnel
@flow TB
@related preview.open-media
@tag media
@tag close

@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer
@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Close media request <input>
- Receive the viewer close command @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
> eligible

[eligible] Can this close run? <decision>
- Reject an unloaded viewer and reject an inactive viewer only when the caller did not force lifecycle cleanup @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
? "Unloaded, or inactive without force" > rejected
? "Eligible viewer" > media

[media] Is media loaded? <decision>
- Check for either a source path or media record @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
? "Nothing is open" > unchanged
? "Media is loaded" > clear

[clear] Clear preview <process>
- Collapse the Flyleaf host before detaching its player @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
- Stop the clock, detach the host player, dispose the player, and null the player reference @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
- Clear source, media, crop, and playback state @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
- Publish an empty media status @ viewer.PViewerMediaClose(...)
> timeline

[timeline] Propagate empty media <output>
- Let the active window subscription clear its connected flow @ window.PWindowMediaHandle(...)
- Let workspace and list-removal lifecycle routes clear their tab flow directly, including inactive flows @ flow.PFlowClear(...)
= Logical viewer state is empty synchronously; host visibility diagnostics are observational and native-frame disappearance may complete separately.

[rejected] Close rejected <error>
= A normal user command cannot close an inactive viewer; lifecycle cleanup must pass the force flag.

[unchanged] No change <output>
= Existing empty state is unchanged.
